//     modification list carries `propertyPath: isPlatformer / value: 1` targeting
//     the PlayerController. The field does not exist in the stripped
//     PlayerController.cs, so today it does nothing — a leftover from the
//     project's own build, and the project's own answer to "which world am I in?"
//     (option (c)). Unity keys those overrides by field NAME, so declaring a
//     serialized field with exactly that name picks the tick up. The walkthrough
//     says so and tells the student to check the box rather than trust it.
//   - Do not call the cave's ground body "Gravity Scale 0" — the Collision tilemap
//     is a Static body whose Inspector reads Gravity Scale 1, greyed out.
//   - SceneSwitch.cs really does switch scenes from OnCollisionEnter2D, so the
